WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.550
♪ It's not easy ♪

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.100
If you're with me, I can do it right now

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.100
Ready set go

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.090
It's not the same

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:40.060
No, no, no, no.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:43.320
I forgot to set the alarm clock.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:50.900
I forgot to fight in the middle of a fight.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:53.770
Oh, no matter how many times I look at it,

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:57.790
the huge battle system of PPSE is overwhelming.

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:00.000
Oh, all right.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:04.530
Is Seikun and the others alive?

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:05.650
Hm?

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:08.760
That's...

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:11.620
What?

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:17.480
That giant Gunpla is...

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:21.140
No way!

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:22.880
Why?

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:40.140
What the hell is that big thing?!

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:48.950
As you requested, President, we've put a Gunpla with automatic control into the battlefield.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:50.530
Thank you, Chan.

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:55.610
And then I found out the name of the fighter in Star Build Strike.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:59.960
It's not a full name, but it's registered with the name Rage.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.280
I-I see.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.340
Even the name is the same.

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:08.480
So Arian is after me...

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:11.600
No, no, that's not it.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:16.070
But if that's the case...

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:28.320
It looks like a Zaku with a size model, but...

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:31.730
What does this mean?

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:47.380
I don't think there was a Gunpla like that at the start of the battle.

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.400
Did someone change the machine?

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.680
That's...

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:51.760
That guy, Goku!

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:33.020
I see. That Gunpla is...

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:38.420
The unmanned aircraft stored in the battle system for the anti-computer.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:42.460
So that's what moved it.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:45.380
Why?

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.990
Who's doing this?!

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:52.250
What's wrong, Kawaguchi?

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.030
Megasize?!

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:59.500
President, it seems that the unmanned Zaku is rampaging in the field.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.640
Stop the battle right now.

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:03.110
I don't need it.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.420
What?

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:05.960
It's a request.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.620
A request.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.160
No way.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:11.400
The president is going to do that?

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:13.320
Isn't that great?

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:17.760
Gunpla fans all over the world are looking forward to this tournament.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.960
We have to make it this flashy.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.150
Right?

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:29.700
The organizer...

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:40.900
It seems that they have put a large gunpla with no fighter in the battlefield. To avoid fighting them, we will change the plan to land on the ground. Maintain the status.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.230
Roger that.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:54.320
Oh, you're doing it for nothing. Let's get away, brother. I don't want to get caught up in the end.

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:05.670
The large Gunpla that was introduced is a surprise event for the organizer!

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:07.870
What's going to happen?

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:10.700
I-I don't know.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.840
But that large Gunpla...

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.850
It looks like it's aiming for Iori-kun's Gunpla...

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:24.190
Damn it!

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.600
I knew it! It's aiming for me!

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:34.170
Get out of here!

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:36.360
That Zaku has nothing to do with the battle!

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.920
You don't need to fight!

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:39.200
I know, but...

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.430
Don't be so stubborn!

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:58.730
That's enough!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.000
Fine, fine!

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.050
What's the name of that mecha?

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:05.200
MS-06F

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.620
Zaku II

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.090
Yeah, yeah! Zaku, Zaku!

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:11.140
Go, Zaku!

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:20.650
Sei!

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:22.040
What are you going to do?

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.910
Are you going to discharge and run away?

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:25.640
That's what I want to do!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:28.590
No way!

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:29.630
Right?

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.810
You're so reckless!

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.730
I have to do that!

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:47.480
You fool!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.100
You idiot!

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:50.760
Aim for the shuriken!

00:07:50.760 --> 00:08:00.000
Oh!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:15.230
Even though it's a battle royale where survival is the priority?

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:18.970
Why would you do such a useless thing?

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.620
It's foolish.

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:24.760
An act like Don Quixote challenging a windmill.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:28.130
But why?

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.000
It's decided.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:35.060
That's because they're the Fighters!

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:41.640
If Long Range isn't good enough!

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:46.930
I'll jump right into it!

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:49.080
Cracker!

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:20.680
I'll give you what you owe me!

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:21.540
Don't mess with me!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.840
What?!

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:25.890
Who do you think you're talking to?!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.970
I will defeat Zaku!

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:48.690
You don't have to follow the president's game.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:49.870
But!

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:53.130
Our goal is only to win.

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:55.060
Don't forget your position.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:01.990
I know.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:05.060
It's a heavy attack!

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.280
Discharge!

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:48.050
I'll send the enemy to the attack!

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.940
*Gasp*

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:21.610
It's a machine! It's a machine!

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:24.040
What!?

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:27.170
Hurry!

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.140
We've been silenced!

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:34.960
Seito and Reiji did it!

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:43.190
We've finally reached a certain number of people!

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:47.300
The buzzer of the end of the second period has sounded!

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:50.310
Phew...

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:57.560
I hope Iori-kun's Gunpla is safe.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.430
What do you think, Sui?

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:00.000
It's fine!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:04.650
It's fine. There's a backup for the shield, and if it's this bad, we can fix it in one night.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:08.700
I see. Please.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.630
I know. Leave it to me.

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:13.630
Mao-kun, what about Mao-kun's Gunpla?

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:17.710
I also have a backup for the Satellite Cannon, so I can fix it right away.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:20.980
Ferry Nihon also said it wasn't a big deal.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.910
Oh, that's good.

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:30.000
It seems that Sei-kun and his Gunpla are safe.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:37.930
But even if it's a surprise, I can't believe they're putting a mega-sized Gunpla in a battle.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:45.180
And it seems like they were only aiming for that Zaku and Seikun's Star Build Strike.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:54.260
It may be too much to think about, but I can't help but be upset.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:08.910
What is it, Riccardo Fellini?

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:14.520
I thought I'd say thanks to Nils Nielsen.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:19.420
You saved me.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:22.370
Grazie, Samurai Boy.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.680
I can't thank you.

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.000
That's not thanks.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:35.730
I did it to prolong the battle and to check your Gunpla's performance.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:39.440
Oh, so you had that meeting?

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:45.000
It was meaningful. Especially, the Star Build Strike that Iori Sei produced.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:15:00.000
The shield of that Gunpla is not something that will destroy the beam that the opponent has released. It is a shield that is deployed and transformed into beam particles to absorb it into the main body.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:06.950
In the end, the attack that defeated Zaku will not explain the huge amount of particles.

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:13.440
But if I understand the principle, I can deal with it.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:19.550
Even if I have to face him next time, my victory is the weakest.

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:23.070
What do you mean by the weakest?

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:25.050
You are making an absurd theory.

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:27.770
You are not honest.

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:30.000
The battle just now...

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.960
Look at him. He's got a fever inside his chest.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:43.640
Fighter registered name.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:44.690
Reiji.

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:46.200
Same name.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:50.310
If he's growing up, he might look like this.

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:53.850
He's too much for someone else's Sorani.

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:59.480
But if that's the case, why isn't he doing anything?

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.200
Am I over-thinking things?

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:09.540
I told you to give it to me!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:16.700
Oh, hello there, Kawaguchi Meijin.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.280
You're here.

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:20.830
You look like you're doing well.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.590
What's up, all of a sudden?

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:24.590
President Mashita.

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:27.160
Even though you're the host of the tournament,

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.550
I'd like you to respect my selfishness.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:30.000
Huh?

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:30.980
What's that?

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:33.700
Oh, you were talking about Zaku?

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.710
Isn't that great?

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.730
The number of views on the TV that was being broadcasted...

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:41.300
It jumped up with that surprise!

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:44.310
The mass-produced company is also very happy about it.

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:48.170
Meijin, please make the fans happy with your flashy performance!

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:49.850
I'm begging you!

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:52.280
Ouch!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.480
The chairman's forehead hurts!

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:57.840
I want you to be modest with your selfish imitations.

00:16:57.840 --> 00:17:00.000
Meijin, stop it!

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:04.100
President, you're being selfish.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:07.130
I won't do it, I won't do it! I won't do it anymore!

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:08.750
Then, it's fine.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:16.290
I interrupted you. I'll excuse myself.

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:19.500
- President, it's OK! - It hurts! My arm hurts!

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:25.040
Let go of me! Let go of me!

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:28.210
It hurts, it hurts. Let go of me!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.350
It's healed.

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:35.270
Jeez, it's a problem for President Mashita as well.

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:39.930
How rude of you to do such a selfish thing.

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:42.750
You're the one who did it, though.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.520
What do you mean?

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:46.780
You don't need to know.

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:51.050
When the mega-sized Zaku was rampaging,

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:58.070
you used a long-range sniper rifle to shoot him down.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:02.300
You can tell just by looking at the beam.

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:06.550
I was the one who designed the basic design of that rifle.

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:09.120
Then I'll tell you.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:14.190
What value does it have to defeat a wounded Gunpla and gain victory?

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:17.100
It's not just about winning.

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:20.570
It's about overwhelming the opponent in the best condition.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:28.610
I, Meijin Tariul, have no intention of taking a single step to prove that.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.700
It's time for dinner!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:39.690
We'll continue our work as it is.

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:42.530
Reiji, you're going shopping again, aren't you?

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:43.350
Grr...

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.230
Then go buy something at the convenience store.

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:50.410
I-I got it!

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:59.480
Absorb system that transforms the enemy's particle beam and absorbs it.

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:07.760
But it's not just Ruan-san who has that secret.

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:10.820
It's better for other fighters to know about it, too.

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:16.840
And the Discharge System will release all of the absorbed particles.

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:22.690
Depending on the situation, it may be used.

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:24.710
The Absorb System.

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:28.800
The third system after the Discharge System.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:50.710
What's this? A meat bun?

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:56.080
The money you gave me the other day was too much, so I'll pay you back for the difference.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:20:00.000
You! Why did you go out of your way to take a bath here just for this?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.660
You've been waiting for a long time?

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:09.160
I don't want you to keep making借り , so I just wanted to give it back as soon as possible.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.540
What?

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.080
I don't need it.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.430
It's cold, isn't it?

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:16.040
It can't be helped.

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:18.340
I don't know when it will come.

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:21.720
I'm not asking you to wait for anyone.

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:22.840
Take it.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:24.140
I don't need it.

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:29.250
Then I don't feel sorry.

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:38.980
What is it? What is it?

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:41.360
What's wrong with you, kid?

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:44.210
No, not here.

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:47.440
What the hell are you talking about?

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:49.530
What?

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:51.240
Huh?

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:53.910
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:57.280
You!

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:59.190
Stop it already.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:16.830
Hey, hey, you're in front of her, so don't act cool, kid!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:23.240
If there's an ash you want to grab, no matter how many times you get hurt

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:01.350
I'm sorry

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:55.390
Why do you care so much about that boy named Reiji?

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:57.910
Do I have to tell you the reason?

00:22:57.910 --> 00:23:00.000
If you don't want to tell me...

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:04.540
I don't mind. I'm just going to follow the president.

00:23:04.540 --> 00:23:08.580
That's fine. So, what about the defense?

00:23:08.580 --> 00:23:13.310
As requested by the president, the next third period...

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:17.890
Iori Sei. I've arranged a representative of the Reiji group.

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:25.980
Their opponent is the representative of Tai, Luan Daraara.

00:23:25.980 --> 00:23:29.000
Their defeat is inevitable.

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:36.390
It's impossible for this boy to be a prince.

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:37.980
But...

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:40.060
The fact that there's a boy with that kind of look on his face...

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:42.970
It really doesn't bother me at all.

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:58.500
A match with Ruan Dalaran!

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:00.000
What the hell is this?!

00:24:01.020 --> 00:24:02.680
Next episode: Battle Weapon!

00:24:02.680 --> 00:24:04.480
I'm scared of coincidences.
